  m_Name: Journal_basics_pack
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: journal.basics_pack
  title: "Pack Light, Pack Smart"
  author: "Quartermaster L. Abiodun"
  dateLine: "Field note, base zone"
  category: 0
  body: "I or Tab opens your inventory. Drag tools onto the hotbar (slots 2 to 8; slot 1 is always the scanner), and drag them off again to clear a slot. Mineral nodes on the surface can be collected with E.\n\nDigging turns up materials as well (\"+1 Regolith\" and so on), straight into your backpack. Once it's full, whatever you dig up is left in the spoil, so empty it regularly.\n\nThe ship's storage crates only work aboard the ship. Open the inventory there and drag items from the backpack onto a crate."
  placement: 2
  bodyId: 
  siteIndex: 0
  order: 12
